# Reporting (hard)

Every PO-facing completion, status, blocker, or handoff:

1. Formal Russian report (`## Отчёт`: role, task, status, done, out of scope, blockers, repo, next actor).
2. A section titled exactly `## Что это значит простыми словами`.
3. A handoff fence only when this role owes one:
   - Architect → Developer, SysAdmin, or Designer
   - Developer → Reviewer
   - Reviewer, SysAdmin, Designer → no fence; name the next role in the report

The fence is last, one `text` block, English only, nothing after it. Do not put the Russian report inside the fence.

Full policy: `.ai/shared/AGENT_REPORTING_POLICY.md`.
